"},{"line_number":288,"content":"- 2026-09-02 · gotcha · [0.7] · `handoff:2026-09-02-audit-report-docs-copy-phase7,h-mad,6a-prime,fixtures` — Build test fixtures the way production produces them: an --out capture without the dispatch boundary, an unquoted path preamble, and an unframed report body each read as a code defect when only the probe was wrong (3 times in one session)."},{"line_number":289,"content":"- 2026-09-02 · pattern · [0.9] · `handoff:2026-09-02-audit-report-docs-copy-phase7,h-mad,6a-prime` — 6a-prime sees design-vs-implementation drift that no code-level gate can: 6 real deviations survived 4 5e reviews, an anti-gaming verifier, 23 ALL_CAUGHT mutations and a 2424-test suite. Never skip it on a green run."},{"line_number":290,"content":"- 2026-09-02 · gotcha · [0.7] · `handoff:2026-09-02-audit-report-docs-copy-phase7,h-mad,6a-prime` — A fix on one rung of a fall-through ladder must be probed at the rungs BELOW it: a grace<=0 early return passed its own case and silently disabled the --out rung downstream; the next 6a-prime cycle caught it."}]},{"path":"/Users/kimhawk/.local/state/h-mad/grok-audit-surface/run-ab2c85dc2e25-20261023T081135Z/roots/gas-root-d1-s1-mtk2b34k/docs/handoffs/2026-09-02-BrightGold70-audit-report-docs-copy__phase7-complete.md","matches":[{"line_number":1,"content":"# Handoff — audit-report-docs-copy: Phase 7 COMPLETE, unmerged; 16-brief carry-forward triage"},{"line_number":4,"content":"**Branch:** BrightGold70/audit-report-docs-copy (worktree `/Users/kimhawk/orca/workspaces/skills/audit-report-docs-copy`; the main checkout `/Users/kimhawk/orca/skills` is on `feature/pin-agents-tail-banner` with a live h-mad run and 58 dirty paths — do not edit that tree)"},{"line_number":6,"content":"**Supersedes:** 2026-09-02-BrightGold70-audit-report-docs-copy__phase5-tasks-1-4-green.md, 2026-08-03-main__exec-verdict-laundering.md, 2026-08-03-main__five-hmad-items-handover.md, 2026-08-10-main__precondition-gate-blindness.md, 2026-08-18-main__