{"type":"thought","data":"An important finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" relates to GATE_RE."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's regex for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `GATE_RE` requires "}
{"type":"thought","data":"an exact end-of-line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" match after `should=N`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The actual code allows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" trailing tokens before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the end. A comment "}
{"type":"thought","data":"in the gate code notes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that it anchors on "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`should=N\\s*$` to reject"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `--gated` lines."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan was written"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on 2026-09-02, but "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the current tree is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"from 2026-10-23. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE regex may have"}
{"type":"thought","data":" been relaxed after "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the plan was drafted."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I need to check git"}
{"type":"thought","data":" history to determine"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether the plan accurately"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reflected the code "}
{"type":"thought","data":"at the time it was written."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit rubric requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reading the tree before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" asserting its contents."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A stale regex citation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that no longer matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current code would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be a measurement issue"}
{"type":"thought","data":" if the plan's decision"}
{"type":"thought","data":" depends on that exact"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shape. The plan uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this assumption to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"justify printing `GATE:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" INVALID must=0 should=0`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because `_gate_token`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires that specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" format."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe exact output still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" matches the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex, so the print"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement remains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" valid. The stale citation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a historical artifact,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a functional bug."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Whether this warrants"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a must-fix is uncertain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because the plan was"}
{"type":"thought","data":" already implemented"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the audit targets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the 2026-10-23 cycle."}
