{"type":"thought","data":"The plan slices SKILL.md"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by exact anchors in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan names `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the actual test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file is `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_docs.py`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This false premise "}
{"type":"thought","data":"about the platform is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a build risk."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will verify the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"missing slices file "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and check whether GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" changed since the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was written. The unlink"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line numbers in the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan no longer match"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current code, so"}
{"type":"thought","data":" I need to check git"}
{"type":"thought","data":" history to see if they"}
{"type":"thought","data":" were accurate at plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" time."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe implemented gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" logic has a bug. For"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transport files like"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" splitting on the first"}
{"type":"thought","data":" dot yields `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as the feature name"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because no dot precedes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.report.md`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `split(\".\")[0]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" logic is actually correct."}
{"type":"thought","data":" For transport files,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the stem contains no"}
{"type":"thought","data":" dots, so splitting "}
{"type":"thought","data":"on the first dot yields"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the exact stem. For"}
{"type":"thought","data":" normal audit documents,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it yields the feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prefix. The existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code matches the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec requires "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`<feature>` in the gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" message, but the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses `<stem>`. For "}
{"type":"thought","data":"transport files, `split(\".\")[0]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" produces the exact "}
{"type":"thought","data":"same string as the stem,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the two labels coincide."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This suggests the divergence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may be purely semantic"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a functional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bug."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec defines the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exact gate message "}
{"type":"thought","data":"text, including the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`h_mad_collect_report.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path. The plan abbreviates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this with an ellipsis,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the spec is the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"source of truth for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the precise string."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's ellipsis"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not violate the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec. The word \"exactly\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" applies only to the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE line, so the marker"}
{"type":"thought","data":" text is abbreviated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than omitted."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a nit, not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a must-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-3.1 only requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the line to contain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `transport file`. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" full marker text is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the spec description."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan addresses "}
{"type":"thought","data":"FR-3. Classification:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implemented-as-written,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with a possible restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the feature slot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name.\n\nAxis C: \"restated\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" means the design covers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it in a different, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"usually narrower form."}
{"type":"thought","data":" At FR granularity. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"If the plan covers FR-3's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" behavior, it's implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The stem vs feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a wording difference"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that doesn't narrow"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the behavior given "}
{"type":"thought","data":"dot-free stems. I might"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mention it as a nit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or should-fix if the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec and plan could"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be read as different.\n\nThe plan contains "}
{"type":"thought","data":"an internal contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Its Scope line still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses `<feature>`, while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Requirements FR-3 uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `<stem>`. The Scope"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was never updated to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" match the clarified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" wording."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis is a should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" terminology inconsistency."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The requirements section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" defines the slot more"}
{"type":"thought","data":" precisely than the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"scope line, so an implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" could diverge if they"}
{"type":"thought","data":" parse the feature name"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the transport "}
{"type":"thought","data":"filename instead of "}
#hmad-beat 08:16:58Z grok running 241s
{"type":"thought","data":"using the full stem."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's regex `GATE_RE`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is `\\s*$`, but the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"code uses `(?:\\s+\\S+)*\\s*$`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a concrete "}
{"type":"thought","data":"behavior divergence."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's regex `\\s*$`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would permit trailing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fields after `should=0`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which contradicts the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan's assumption that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the token must end "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exactly there. I need"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to check git history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to see if this was "}
{"type":"thought","data":"true at plan authoring."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan also contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an internal contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in its success criteria:"}
