{"type":"thought","data":" is a measurement error."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The spec and FR-6 both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list 23, so an implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot satisfy the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan's success criterion."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a must-fix."}
