{"type":"thought","data":"must be fixed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 25-mutation count"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a stale published"}
{"type":"thought","data":" number. The design-audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and 5b-audit versions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" updated the body to"}
