{"type":"thought","data":" for FR-2, but the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract line omits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan narrows the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" COLLECT token set by"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omitting CONFLICT. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"This is a restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" issue under Axis C "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and must be fixed.\n\n"}
{"type":"thought","data":"FR-2 also contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" itself. It lists OK|MISSING"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but goals and architecture"}
{"type":"thought","data":" require MISSING|CONFLICT."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe requirements contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the bug. It cannot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be implemented as written"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while satisfying the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" architecture.\n\nThe "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan omits `--grace`."}
