{"type":"thought","data":"An important finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" about `combine()` has"}
{"type":"thought","data":" been identified."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\n`combine()` maps an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" INVALID transport verdict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to `UNVERIFIED` with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reason `no_gate_sections:p<i>`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a missing-sections"}
{"type":"thought","data":" label, not a transport-file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reason. The spec explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires this behavior."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's signal "}
{"type":"thought","data":"discipline aligns with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec. It forbids"}
{"type":"thought","data":" new verdict words, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"so reusing `no_gate_sections`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for a transport refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is acceptable."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nTRANSPORT_RE is confined"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the gate module."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Production scripts "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and the CLI do not import"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it. Tests are the only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consumers. The plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" single-source claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" holds."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-3 is implemented"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as written.\n\nThe plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" success criteria of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 25 may be a miscount."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The spec contains 23"}
{"type":"thought","data":" named mutants and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" JSON contains 23.\n\n"}
{"type":"thought","data":"A stale risk cell needs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixing. It says to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"use the worktree CLI"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after task 2, but task"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2 is the gate and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" CLI is task 3. v1.4"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reordered the cycle"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the tracer runs "}
{"type":"thought","data":"after task 3.\n\nFR-2's missing CONFLICT"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is confirmed in the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quoted file.\n\nThe report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be written to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the exact path, the "}
{"type":"thought","data":".done marker created,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and terminal sentinels"}
{"type":"thought","data":" emitted. The coordinator"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reads the file; the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" user sees the terminal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" output."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe report will be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" written directly to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the target path without"}
{"type":"thought","data":" staging. Empty sections"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will use the word None"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without a bullet. Brackets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are optional inside"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the file but required"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the terminal output."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nClass lines and quoted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lines are continuations,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not bullets. The report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" draft is being structured"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with a classification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table for FR-1 through"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-6."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-4, FR-5, and FR-6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit covered 7"}
{"type":"thought","data":" files and 18 greps."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Rechecking the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" yields 40 acceptance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" criteria headings. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The execution script"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still lacks an option"}
{"type":"thought","data":" loop. Only 4 report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature files exist"}
{"type":"thought","data":" instead of 7. The test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is absent."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe report structure"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is now fixed. The Summary"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will contain 2-3 sentences,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the Axis C table, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the evidence line.\n\n"}
{"type":"thought","data":"Must-fix items are the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-2 token set and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the 25 versus 23 mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count.\n\nShould-fix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"items are grace, the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stale task-2 versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" CLI risk, the wrong"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test filename, and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the stale phase-7 census."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nNits include next "}
{"type":"thought","data":"steps v1.0, feature "}
{"type":"thought","data":"versus stem in scope"}
{"type":"thought","data":" versus requirements,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and possibly an omitted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" write rung.\n\nThe phase-7 census"}
{"type":"thought","data":" finding is valid for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan alone because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the count appears in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both documents.\n\nFor"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the grace should-fix,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec's `--grace"}
{"type":"thought","data":" <s>` signature will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be quoted alongside"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's FR-2 contract,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which omits that option."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's CLI contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is `h_mad_collect_report.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with `COLLECT: OK|MISSING"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path=<docs path>`. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The spec quote for grace"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be included. Task-order"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quotes are plan-only."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The missing test file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_docs.py`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which the spec AC-5.2"}
{"type":"thought","data":" says passes unchanged."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The phase-7 census "}
{"type":"thought","data":"quote comes from line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 143, where the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumes seven `*.report.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" files exist.\n\nThe archive report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `gate-blindness-hardening.report.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sits outside `docs/features/`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so a simple prefix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"match would miss it."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan’s `prefix+suffix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" |` rule correctly catches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both locations. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" executed census assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was dated 2026-09-02."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe census count is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" now 4, not 7. The suffix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule still covers the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" archived example and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the four feature reports."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" measurement finding,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a must-fix. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" re-derivation will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be noted in the evidence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line to keep the summary"}
{"type":"thought","data":" brief."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe report file will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be written first. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.done` marker will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be created only after"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that write succeeds."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe report will be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" composed in full before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the write call. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" draft is being tightened"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to use affirmative "}
{"type":"thought","data":"phrasing and exact quote"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spans, with contrastive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" negation removed where"}
{"type":"thought","data":" possible."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nExact quote spans "}
{"type":"thought","data":"are being copied verbatim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the read output."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's FR-2 contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is `COLLECT: OK|MISSING"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path=<docs path>`. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The spec adds `|CONFLICT`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's success "}
{"type":"thought","data":"line reads `(25 mutations,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" every connection dropped`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The spec's 23-mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line is `→ AC-2.10 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bites. 23 mutations.`."}
